mapping rules
├── when applying snake case
│   ├── it joins words with underscores
│   └── it drops punctuation
├── when a strip prefix is configured
│   ├── it removes it case insensitively
│   ├── it leaves other text untouched
│   └── it survives multibyte text at the boundary
└── when applying pascal case
    └── it capitalizes each word
